"""Shared fixtures.

The headless setup -- ``QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen``, ``QT_API``,
``PYTEST_QT_API`` and ``MPLBACKEND`` -- is **not** here. It lives in
``endstation``'s pytest plugin, which is loaded through an entry point and so
runs before any conftest is imported. That timing is the whole difficulty: both
Qt's platform plugin and matplotlib's backend bind at first import, and a root
conftest is imported before ``pytest_configure`` runs.

All of it uses ``setdefault``, so ``QT_QPA_PLATFORM=cocoa pytest tests/`` still
opens a real window -- which is the fastest way to debug a layout problem.
"""
